      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-01-12T18:37:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Oh, you\u0027re right. Good catch.\nUnfortunately, net.SplitHostPort returns an error if the port is missing, which I wouldn\u0027t want to parse. So, I copied stripPort from https://golang.org/src/net/url/url.go?s\u003d27961:27992#L994.",
      "parentUuid": "6395feaf_6cf338e9",
      "tag": "autogenerated:gerrit:newPatchSet",
      "revId": "527a815c925055b67c4eb70a86d87bd9696df705",
